{
"classname" "game_messagebox"
"origin" "-344 -360 232"
"targetname" "info_objectives"
"title" "How the objectives run"
"message" "Three trigger_objective entities, List position 1, 2 and 3. obj_power starts Active; the other two start Hidden.\n\nEach trigger moves an objective one step on: a hidden one becomes active, an active one is completed and fires its Target when completed.\n\nThe power button completes obj_power, whose target obj_card then shows. The keycard (item_pickup, Item name keycard_red) has Target obj_card, so taking it completes obj_card, which shows obj_door.\n\nThe security button has Master card_check, a player_hasinventory with Item name keycard_red. It opens the door and completes obj_door, whose target ends the mission 5 seconds later (game_end)."
}
